	measure 'Total Gendered Referrals' = ```
			CALCULATE ( [Total Referrals], KEEPFILTERS ( FILTER ( 'dim_person', NOT ISBLANK ( 'dim_person'[gender_clean] ) && 'dim_person'[gender_clean] <> "Unknown" ) ) )
			```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: Referral Volume KPIs
