	measure 'Non-Framework Providers' = ```
			COUNTROWS (
			    EXCEPT (
			        VALUES ( 'dim_provider'[provider_id] ),
			        VALUES ( 'bridge_provider_framework'[provider_id] )
			    )
			)
			```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: Provider Registry
		lineageTag: 75b5f1e4-a107-42df-8f7e-62906d7cea09

	measure 'Is Non Framework Provider' = ```
